      "content": "i know people say things get better but they dont get it. you can't just \"navigate\" through this. the version of me that people respected, that actually existed in the world, is dead. even if i survive this, i'm just a hollow shell of a person. it feels like i'm just dragging around a corpse of my former self. why bother trying to fix something that's fundamentally broken beyond repair?",
